FIXED (both on /unit/[unitId]/jump — a no-design screen, outside the parity lock):
  1. P2 jump load-error dead end: the load error was INVISIBLE (error text rendered only inside the
     question card, which requires `current` = undefined on load failure) and offered no recovery.
     -> dedicated load-error card with a "تلاش دوباره" retry button; loadAssessment is now a
        retryable useCallback. File: apps/mobile/app/unit/[unitId]/jump.tsx
  2. P2 lying progress bar: `width: Math.max(progress, 20)%` showed 20% at zero answers — against
     the progress-honesty principle (and the skill's "progress bars that lie" anti-pattern).
     -> honest `width: progress%` on mobile AND web (apps/web/components/JumpAssessmentView.tsx).

